: "Un día, un gigante llamado Goliat hizo temblar de miedo a todos.", "sfx": "whoosh", "capas": [{"tipo": "fondo", "media": "jobs/religioso-infantil-02-david-goliat/capa_01_0.jpg", "z": 2000, "ancho": 1.1}], "start": 7.206, "end": 13.884, "words": [{"text": "Un", "start": 7.317, "end": 7.485}, {"text": "día,", "start": 7.5, "end": 7.82}, {"text": "un", "start": 8.247, "end": 8.354}, {"text": "gigante", "start": 8.369, "end": 8.841}, {"text": "llamado", "start": 8.857, "end": 9.344}, {"text": "Goliat", "start": 9.36, "end": 9.863}, {"text": "hizo", "start": 9.878, "end": 10.152}, {"text": "temblar", "start": 10.168, "end": 10.701}, {"text": "de", "start": 10.716, "end": 10.808}, {"text": "miedo", "start": 10.823, "end": 11.28}, {"text": "a", "start": 11.296, "end": 11.372}, {"text": "todos.", "start": 11.387, "end": 12.058}]}, {"bloque": "escena_3d", "texto": "David dijo: no tengo miedo, porque Dios está conmigo.", "sfx": null, "capas": [{"tipo": "fondo", "media": "jobs/religioso-infantil-02-david-goliat/capa_02_0.jpg", "z": 2000, "ancho": 1.1}], "start": 13.884, "end": 20.202, "words": [{"text": "David", "start": 13.995, "end": 14.467}, {"text": "dijo:", "start": 14.483, "end": 14.955}, {"text": "no", "start": 15.336, "end": 15.519}, {"text": "tengo", "start": 15.535, "end": 15.87}, {"text": "miedo,", "start": 15.885, "end": 16.327}, {"text": "porque", "start": 16.663, "end": 16.968}, {"text": "Dios", "start": 16.983, "end": 17.379}, {"text": "está", "start": 17.394, "end": 17.684}, {"text": "conmigo.", "start": 17.699, "end": 18.37}]}, {"bloque": "escena_3d", "texto": "No quiso una armadura pesada. Eligió cinco piedritas lisas del arroyo.", "sfx": "whoosh", "capas": [{"tipo": "fondo", "media": "jobs/religioso-infantil-02-david-goliat/capa_03_0.jpg", "z": 2000, "ancho": 1.1}], "start": 20.202, "end": 28.224, "words": [{"text": "No", "start": 20.313, "end": 20.557}, {"text": "quiso", "start": 20.572, "end": 20.953}, {"text": "una", "start": 20.968, "end": 21.228}, {"text": "armadura", "start": 21.243, "end": 21.792}, {"text": "pesada.", "start": 21.807, "end": 22.447}, {"text": "Eligió", "start": 23.51, "end": 24.013}, {"text": "cinco", "start": 24.028, "end": 24.486}, {"text": "piedritas", "start": 24.501, "end": 25.217}, {"text": "lisas", "start": 25.232, "end": 25.659}, {"text": "del", "start": 25.675, "end": 25.842}, {"text": "arroyo.", "start": 25.857, "end": 26.422}]}, {"bloque": "escena_3d", "texto": "Goliat se rio: ¿tú, tan pequeño? Pero David confiaba en Dios.", "sfx": null, "capas": [{"tipo": "fondo", "media": "jobs/religioso-infantil-02-david-goliat/capa_04_0.jpg", "z": 2000, "ancho": 1.1}], "start": 28.224, "end": 36.27, "words": [{"text": "Goliat", "start": 28.335, "end": 28.853}, {"text": "se", "start": 28.868, "end": 29.051}, {"text": "rio:", "start": 29.067, "end": 29.524}, {"text": "¿tú,", "start": 29.829, "end": 30.103}, {"text": "tan", "start": 30.362, "end": 30.576}, {"text": "pequeño?", "start": 30.591, "end": 31.231}, {"text": "Pero", "start": 32.309, "end": 32.523}, {"text": "David", "start": 32.538, "end": 33.056}, {"text": "confiaba", "start": 33.072, "end": 33.757}, {"text": "en", "start": 33.773, "end": 33.895}, {"text": "Dios.", "start": 33.91, "end": 34.443}]}, {"bloque": "escena_3d", "texto": "David giró su honda y lanzó una piedrita con mucha fe.", "sfx": "whoosh", "capas": [{"tipo": "fondo", "media": "jobs/religioso-infantil-02-david-goliat/capa_05_0.jpg", "z": 2000, "ancho": 1.1}], "start": 36.27, "end": 42.132, "words": [{"text": "David", "start": 36.381, "end": 36.869}, {"text": "giró", "start": 36.884, "end": 37.219}, {"text": "su", "start": 37.235, "end": 37.509}, {"text": "honda", "start": 37.524, "end": 37.905}, {"text": "y", "start": 37.921, "end": 37.997}, {"text": "lanzó", "start": 38.012, "end": 38.469}, {"text": "una", "start": 38.485, "end": 38.759}, {"text": "piedrita", "start": 38.774, "end": 39.369}, {"text": "con", "start": 39.384, "end": 39.597}, {"text": "mucha", "start": 39.613, "end": 39.994}, {"text": "fe.", "start": 40.009, "end": 40.299}]}, {"bloque": "escena_3d", "texto": "¡Y el gigante cayó! Todos entendieron que Dios ayuda a los valientes.", "sfx": null, "capas": [{"tipo": "fondo", "media": "jobs/religioso-infantil-02-david-goliat/capa_06_0.jpg", "z": 2000, "ancho": 1.1}], "start": 42.132, "end": 49.89, "words": [{"text": "¡Y", "start": 42.243, "end": 42.38}, {"text": "el", "start": 42.395, "end": 42.548}, {"text": "gigante", "start": 42.563, "end": 43.127}, {"text": "cayó!", "start": 43.142, "end": 43.676}, {"text": "Todos", "start": 44.739, "end": 45.12}, {"text": "entendieron", "start": 45.135, "end": 45.791}, {"text": "que", "start": 45.806, "end": 45.943}, {"text": "Dios", "start": 45.958, "end": 46.324}, {"text": "ayuda", "start": 46.339, "end": 46.903}, {"text": "a", "start": 46.919, "end": 46.964}, {"text": "los", "start": 46.98, "end": 47.193}, {"text": "valientes.", "start": 47.208, "end": 48.062}]}, {"bloque": "escena_3d", "texto": "Cuando algo te dé miedo, recuerda: con Dios, eres más fuerte.", "sfx": "whoosh", "capas": [{"tipo": "fondo", "media": "jobs/religioso-infantil-02-david-goliat/capa_07_0.jpg", "z": 2000, "ancho": 1.1}], "start": 49.89, "end": 56.688, "words": [{"text": "Cuando", "start": 50.001, "end": 50.352}, {"text": "algo", "start": 50.367, "end": 50.656}, {"text": "te", "start": 50.672, "end": 50.809}, {"text": "dé", "start": 50.824, "end": 50.946}, {"text": "miedo,", "start": 50.961, "end": 51.373}, {"text": "recuerda:", "start": 51.693, "end": 52.227}, {"text": "con", "start": 52.653, "end": 52.897}, {"text": "Dios,", "start": 52.913, "end": 53.355}, {"text": "eres", "start": 53.629, "end": 53.98}, {"text": "más", "start": 53.995, "end": 54.284}, {"text": "fuerte.", "start": 54.3, "end": 54.864}]}]}